  "How do I call an ambulance in China?": "在中國如何叫救護車？",
  "Dial 120 for ambulance services. Most large hospitals have English-speaking staff. Major cities also have international clinics. Contact your hotel for translation help.": "撥打120叫救護車。大多數大型醫院有會說英語的員工。主要城市也有國際診所。可聯絡您的飯店尋求翻譯協助。",
  "Can I use my foreign health insurance in China?": "我可以在中國使用我的外國健康保險嗎？",
  "Most foreign health insurances do not cover treatment in China directly. You may need to pay upfront and claim later. Check with your insurance about direct payment options or international coverage.": "大多數外國健康保險不直接涵蓋在中國的治療費用。您可能需要先自付費用，之後再申請理賠。請向您的保險公司確認是否有直接付款選項或國際涵蓋範圍。",
  "What if I get scammed and lose money?": "如果我被詐騙並損失金錢怎麼辦？",
  "File a police report immediately. Contact your bank to try to stop the transfer. Report to the platform if it was an online transaction. Unfortunately, recovery rate is low.": "立即報警並取得報案證明。聯絡您的銀行嘗試停止轉帳。如果是線上交易，請向平臺舉報。不幸的是，追回款項的機率很低。",
