  "A Representative Office must have a Chinese host company (host enterprise) that acts as the sponsor. The host manages tax filings and HR on behalf of the RO.": "代表處必須有一家中國主辦公司（主辦企業）作為擔保方。主辦公司代表代表處處理稅務申報及人力資源事宜。",
