  "Save your embassy&apos;s emergency number before travel. Most embassies have 24/7 emergency lines for citizens abroad. In serious emergencies (lost passport, detention, hospitalization), contact your embassy immediately.": "旅行前請儲存您所在大使館的緊急電話號碼。大多數大使館為海外公民提供24小時緊急專線。若發生嚴重緊急情況（如護照遺失、被拘留、住院），請立即聯繫您的大使館。",
